#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 4c4439e61199444da73060a26bbc9a8e Models.ipynb:9
#: Series Time
msgid "Time Series Models"
msgstr "时间序列模型"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:11 Series Time
#: a66587d78dee4c5d8eeb2043a46bb82d
msgid ""
"**PyBroker v2** introduces support for backtesting time series models. "
"Instead of relying on a single row of features, these models make "
"predictions based on a series' own past values."
msgstr ""
"**PyBroker v2** 引入了对时间序列模型回测的支持。这类模型不再依赖单行特征，而是基于序列自身的历史值进行预测。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 11bf2f992db9499ca3a3656d7aef63ab Models.ipynb:13
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"To show how this works, we will backtest two different strategies. The "
"first relies on a volatility forecast from a `GARCH(1,1) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Autoregressive_conditional_heteroskedasticity>`__"
" model built with the `arch <https://arch.readthedocs.io/>`__ library. "
"The second strategy uses a rolling regression that is refit on every bar."
" Since **PyBroker** does not include ``arch`` by default, you must "
"install it first by running ``pip install arch``."
msgstr ""
"为了展示其工作原理，我们将回测两种不同的策略。第一种策略依赖于使用 `arch <https://arch.readthedocs.io/>`__ "
"库构建的 `GARCH(1,1) "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Autoregressive_conditional_heteroskedasticity>`__"
" 模型给出的波动率预测。第二种策略使用一个在每根 K 线上都重新拟合的滚动回归模型。由于 **PyBroker** 默认不包含 ``arch``，"
"你必须先运行 ``pip install arch`` 进行安装。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:66 Series Time
#: e547fbf69ca743edbf3da8d0b9d6f4c6
msgid "Forecasting Volatility with GARCH"
msgstr "使用 GARCH 预测波动率"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 9536318fef484944bc44200086393f70 Models.ipynb:68
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"GARCH will model the volatility of a return series, so we start by "
"defining an `indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.indicator>`__"
" for log returns:"
msgstr ""
"GARCH 用于对收益率序列的波动率进行建模，因此我们首先为对数收益率定义一个 `indicator "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.indicator.html#pybroker.indicator.indicator>`__："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 3ab24f63dbff44a4a71a0787b0dfb112 Models.ipynb:96
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"The training function scales the log returns to percentages for more "
"reliable estimation:"
msgstr "训练函数会将对数收益率缩放为百分比，以获得更可靠的估计："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 7416a9dcea4245e99c402feb47195ed2 Models.ipynb:128
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"The model is built using the combined returns from both the train and "
"test windows. However, passing ``last_obs`` ensures that parameter "
"estimation relies solely on the train window and isolates the test "
"returns to prevent data leakage."
msgstr ""
"该模型使用训练窗口和测试窗口合并后的收益率进行构建。不过，传入 ``last_obs`` "
"可确保参数估计仅依赖训练窗口，并将测试收益率隔离开来，以防止数据泄漏。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 4c2be12666144befbbbab496c1698089 Models.ipynb:130
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"For every test data bar, the prediction function uses the trained model "
"to forecast the variance of the next bar:"
msgstr "对于每根测试数据 K 线，预测函数都会使用已训练的模型来预测下一根 K 线的方差："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:158 Series Time
#: a244459ca7244b6090d1baea55de29c0
msgid ""
"Because the model already stores the full return series, the model input "
"is only the location of the current bar. The forecast then only uses "
"returns up to that point."
msgstr ""
"由于模型已经保存了完整的收益率序列，因此模型的输入仅为当前 K 线的位置。预测过程只会使用到该位置为止的收益率数据。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 83ecb20f12ee424ea440d2ae25fab45c Models.ipynb:160
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"By default, **PyBroker** passes all test window data to the model in a "
"single call. While this vectorized approach is efficient, it fails for "
"autoregressive models since they rely on the previous step's output to "
"generate their next forecast. Passing ``per_bar=True`` to `model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" will then call `predict_fn "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" once per bar:"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，**PyBroker** 会在一次调用中将全部测试窗口数据传给模型。这种向量化的方式虽然高效，但并不适用于自回归模型，"
"因为这类模型需要依赖上一步的输出来生成下一次预测。此时，向 `model "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 传入 ``per_bar=True`` 会让 `predict_fn "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 每根 K 线调用一次："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 50abc29f6f924b2985ac2b41c33b116c Models.ipynb:187
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"The strategy uses the volatility forecast from `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__"
" as a regime filter. It enters with `set_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.set_target_shares>`__"
" while forecast volatility is below the threshold, and exits with "
"`sell_all_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_all_shares>`__"
" when it rises above:"
msgstr ""
"该策略将 `ctx.preds "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.preds>`__"
" 给出的波动率预测用作市场状态过滤器：当预测波动率低于阈值时，使用 `set_target_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.set_target_shares>`__"
" 建仓；当波动率升至阈值以上时，使用 `sell_all_shares "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.sell_all_shares>`__"
" 平仓："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 73a727b29fa043b6aa926f3813ed31fb Models.ipynb:718
#: Series Time
msgid "Random Forest on Lagged Returns"
msgstr "基于滞后收益率的随机森林"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:720 Series Time
#: f9bb6235365149e7bed038b25dda6206
msgid ""
"The second strategy trains a `RandomForestRegressor <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.ensemble.RandomForestRegressor.html>`__"
" to predict the next bar's return from lagged returns."
msgstr ""
"第二种策略训练一个 `RandomForestRegressor <https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.ensemble.RandomForestRegressor.html>`__，"
"根据滞后收益率来预测下一根 K 线的收益率。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:749 Series Time
#: a4f4562693c04d8a9fa57e0d8b2f3d35
msgid ""
"The training function receives ``lag_train`` and ``lag_test`` parameters "
"built from the model's `lags "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" configuration. Each is a feature matrix with one row per input bar where"
" every row begins with the bar's ``log_return`` value followed by its "
"lagged values."
msgstr ""
"训练函数会接收根据模型的 `lags "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
" 配置构建的 ``lag_train`` 和 ``lag_test`` 参数。二者均为特征矩阵，每根输入 K 线对应一行，每一行都以该 K 线的 "
"``log_return`` 值开头，后面跟着其滞后值。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. 3cba7d9dfc2b45bfac30485b734759e2 Models.ipynb:751
#: Series Time
msgid ""
"Unlike the per-bar GARCH model, the predict function uses **PyBroker's** "
"default behavior and evaluates the entire test window in a single "
"vectorized call:"
msgstr ""
"与逐 K 线计算的 GARCH 模型不同，该预测函数使用 **PyBroker** 的默认行为，在一次向量化调用中对整个测试窗口进行评估："

#: ../../source/notebooks/16. Models.ipynb:773 Series Time
#: fb0b35e8860f4142ad46db4cd5a772a8
msgid ""
"Registering the model with `lags "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.model.html#pybroker.model.model>`__"
